  "description": {
   "text": "Jack Henry & Associates, Inc.® is a well-rounded financial technology company that strengthens connections between financial institutions and the people and businesses they serve. For 50 years, we have provided technology solutions to help banks and credit unions innovate faster, strategically differentiate, and successfully compete while serving the evolving needs of their accountholders. We empower over 7,200 financial institutions and diverse corporate entities with people-inspired innovation, personal service, and insight-driven solutions.",
